WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:13.624 --> 00:00:15.291
My home island grows near

00:00:16.541 --> 00:00:19.791
When we get there my brothers will bestow on each of you great knowledge

00:00:20.249 --> 00:00:22.624
And hopefully turn this season around

00:00:23.208 --> 00:00:24.208
I don't see anything

00:00:24.749 --> 00:00:30.124
Before you see them...you’ll hear them. Sh, listen

00:00:31.083 --> 00:00:40.041
[singing]
Replay is a joke. It’s good for the officials but bad for the game

00:00:40.083 --> 00:00:43.541
What is that? Some sort of…chant?

00:00:43.541 --> 00:00:50.874
It’s a rant. A Van Gundian rant, Tobias. These monks have taken a vow of no silence

00:00:51.999 --> 00:01:00.374
[singing]
Dwight Howard is always waffling and complaining. He is a coach killer

00:01:00.749 --> 00:01:06.541
Ah, yeah, that’s lovely. I could listen to that for minutes before getting annoyed 

00:01:07.083 --> 00:01:10.499
Oh, there she is! The Isle of Van Gundy 

00:01:10.499 --> 00:01:11.916
[laughs]

00:01:11.916 --> 00:01:13.124
Home sweet home

00:01:14.083 --> 00:01:16.166
[singing]
And if you flop...

00:01:16.166 --> 00:01:18.833
[singing]
You should get a technical…

00:01:18.833 --> 00:01:20.958
[singing]
foul

00:01:20.958 --> 00:01:22.749
[singing]
And if you flop…

00:01:22.749 --> 00:01:25.583
[singing]
You should be fined millions of…

00:01:25.583 --> 00:01:26.999
[singing]
gold!

00:01:26.999 --> 00:01:29.499
[singing]
And if you flop…

00:01:29.499 --> 00:01:32.499
[singing]
You should be suspended from the…

00:01:32.499 --> 00:01:35.791
[singing]
game!

00:01:35.791 --> 00:01:38.958
[singing]
Because flopping ruins the game!

00:01:38.958 --> 00:01:46.874
[singing]
But they don’t listen to us

00:01:46.874 --> 00:01:48.249
[laughs] Brother Stan!

00:01:48.249 --> 00:01:49.041
Brother Jeff! 

00:01:49.041 --> 00:01:49.833
Is that really you?

00:01:49.833 --> 00:01:50.833
How the hell are ya?

00:01:50.833 --> 00:01:53.999
Ugh, terrible! The whole foul review system’s a mess

00:01:53.999 --> 00:01:56.041
Nobody listens to me. How are you?

00:01:56.124 --> 00:01:59.791
I’m miserable. We’re stuck in the damn ninth seed and I’ve tried everything

00:01:59.791 --> 00:02:01.874
Could use a bit of your help, Brother Jeff

00:02:01.874 --> 00:02:04.958
Ah, the Van Gundian Monks will always help a coach in need

00:02:04.958 --> 00:02:07.166
Knights of Detroit, C’mere and form a f--king wall

00:02:07.166 --> 00:02:10.791
I want you to meet my brothers. This here, this is Jeff Van Gundy

00:02:10.791 --> 00:02:11.624
Hello there!

00:02:11.624 --> 00:02:13.041
That’s Ethan Van Gundy

00:02:13.041 --> 00:02:14.291
Pleasure to meet you

00:02:14.291 --> 00:02:15.583
Reff Van Gundy

00:02:16.416 --> 00:02:18.208
That there is Jan Van Gundy

00:02:18.208 --> 00:02:19.208
Greetings

00:02:19.208 --> 00:02:20.416
I'm their second cousin 

00:02:21.499 --> 00:02:23.583
This little guy is Gundy Van Gundy

00:02:23.874 --> 00:02:28.083
He’s severely gundied, so don’t say nothing about
“load management” in front of that one

00:02:28.083 --> 00:02:31.124
Ah! That'll ruin the game and you know it!

00:02:31.124 --> 00:02:33.333
All right. Ethan, can you show the knights to their chambers? 

00:02:33.916 --> 00:02:36.083
Our training begins bright and early tomorrow

00:02:42.458 --> 00:02:45.041
If you can’t make your free throws, they’re gonna hack you all day

00:02:48.208 --> 00:02:53.083
I don’t know, I just sorta feel like…I don’t need analytics to tell me LeBron is good

00:02:53.083 --> 00:02:55.458
You know? I know that. I can see that

00:02:56.333 --> 00:02:59.958
Ugh, I’m just not sure this will be enough, Brother Jeff

00:02:59.958 --> 00:03:04.666
The Lords of Detroit will have me head if we don’t make a run in the playoffs this year

00:03:04.666 --> 00:03:07.916
You know, there is another option. I mean, you are the Master of Trades, right?

00:03:08.208 --> 00:03:08.708
Aye

00:03:08.708 --> 00:03:11.124
Well, I hear whispers of a wealthy lord 

00:03:11.124 --> 00:03:13.749
who’s looking to part ways with his most decorated knight

00:03:14.208 --> 00:03:17.041
If I send a raven now, they can be here on the morrow

00:03:17.166 --> 00:03:18.874
Ugh...I just...

00:03:20.916 --> 00:03:22.458
Ah, screw it. Send the raven

00:03:22.458 --> 00:03:26.833
I think you’re gonna like him, Brother Stan. He’s even balder and louder than I

00:03:28.541 --> 00:03:36.041
Developing! Developing! Developing players! Let’s make a trade, baby! Woooo! 

00:03:37.458 --> 00:03:38.916
Ser Blake Griffin

00:03:39.124 --> 00:03:40.958
But he’s the face of your franchise

00:03:41.166 --> 00:03:42.624
And soon he can be the face of yours

00:03:42.624 --> 00:03:49.541
All right, but…who would you want for him? Tobias is a good developing player

00:03:49.874 --> 00:03:51.166
Yes, him

00:03:51.708 --> 00:03:53.249
All right! You’ve got yourself a dea–

00:03:53.249 --> 00:03:57.208
Also Avery Bradley, Boban the Giant and a first-round pick

00:03:57.416 --> 00:04:02.624
I mean...that’s quite a lot. What kind of contract do you got him under?

00:04:02.624 --> 00:04:05.166
Five years. 171 Million

00:04:05.833 --> 00:04:08.374
Seven hells, that’s a lot of gold

00:04:08.374 --> 00:04:09.291
I mean,

00:04:09.291 --> 00:04:11.666
Ser Griffin’s a marvelous talent and all

00:04:11.666 --> 00:04:13.833
Do you know he once dunked over a horse?

00:04:14.166 --> 00:04:14.749
Clydesdale

00:04:14.749 --> 00:04:22.333
Ah, wow, that’s...that’s really athletic. I just...171 million gold...it’s a lot...

00:04:22.333 --> 00:04:25.749
Oh, and did you know, he’s…funny? 

00:04:25.749 --> 00:04:27.541
Oh? Is...is he now...

00:04:27.666 --> 00:04:29.958
Blake, tell us one of your jokes

00:04:30.374 --> 00:04:33.041
Um...sure...yeah

00:04:34.791 --> 00:04:38.499
Uh, so…cheers. Thanks for coming out everyone…um... 

00:04:38.499 --> 00:04:43.124
So my squire year, some of the older blokes take me to a whorehouse—

00:04:43.291 --> 00:04:45.374
Not that one. Not that one

00:04:46.249 --> 00:04:52.916
Right...um...so a ref walks into a bar...and then a table...and then some chairs…

00:04:57.249 --> 00:04:59.416
[laughs]

00:04:59.458 --> 00:05:01.374
Because he’s…because the ref is blind! 

00:05:01.374 --> 00:05:02.416
[laughs]

00:05:02.416 --> 00:05:03.916
That’s great, laddie

00:05:04.541 --> 00:05:05.541
It’s a deal! 

00:05:12.791 --> 00:05:18.374
Fare thee well, House Pistons! And remember, stay away from those analytics folks!

00:05:19.458 --> 00:05:25.833
[chanting]
Alonzo

00:05:26.458 --> 00:05:28.499
[chanting]
Mourning

00:05:31.458 --> 00:05:32.458
What they doing?

00:05:32.458 --> 00:05:36.999
That there is the ceremonial exodus of the Van Gundys. Watch

00:05:36.999 --> 00:05:44.083
[chanting]
Back cut, down screen, ice, ice

00:05:44.124 --> 00:05:49.333
Go forth to victory! And please give our tidings to the maiden Rihanna!

00:05:49.333 --> 00:05:51.458
Bey! Ah, Bey

00:05:51.458 --> 00:05:52.999
I...don’t think she’s a maiden

00:05:52.999 --> 00:05:54.583
[laughs] This lad!

00:05:54.583 --> 00:05:59.708
I've got a feeling we're going to have a long, bright future together, Blake

